{"status": "answered", "answer": "Foram registrados 507.607 partos espontâneos cefálicos no Rio Grande do Sul entre 2008 e 2025. A quantidade anual foi: 2008: 28.359; 2009: 28.281; 2010: 27.995; 2011: 28.261; 2012: 27.083; 2013: 26.434; 2014: 27.208; 2015: 29.643; 2016: 29.231; 2017: 30.364; 2018: 30.639; 2019: 30.450; 2020: 30.446; 2021: 29.017; 2022: 28.228; 2023: 26.563; 2024: 24.794; 2025: 24.611.", "sql": "SELECT\n  EXTRACT(YEAR FROM i.DT_INTER)::INTEGER AS ano,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT i.N_AIH) AS total_partos\nFROM internacao AS i\nJOIN hospital AS h\n  ON i.CNES = h.CNES\nJOIN municipios AS m\n  ON h.MUNIC_MOV = m.CO_MUNICIPIO_6D\nWHERE i.DIAG_PRINC = 'O800'\n  AND m.SG_UF = 'RS'\nGROUP BY EXTRACT(YEAR FROM i.DT_INTER)\nORDER BY ano ASC", "rows": [[2008, 28359], [2009, 28281], [2010, 27995], [2011, 28261], [2012, 27083], [2013, 26434], [2014, 27208], [2015, 29643], [2016, 29231], [2017, 30364], [2018, 30639], [2019, 30450], [2020, 30446], [2021, 29017], [2022, 28228], [2023, 26563], [2024, 24794], [2025, 24611]], "columns": ["ano", "total_partos"], "truncated": false, "chart": {"type": "line", "points": [[2008, 28359], [2009, 28281], [2010, 27995], [2011, 28261], [2012, 27083], [2013, 26434], [2014, 27208], [2015, 29643], [2016, 29231], [2017, 30364], [2018, 30639], [2019, 30450], [2020, 30446], [2021, 29017], [2022, 28228], [2023, 26563], [2024, 24794], [2025, 24611]]}, "project": "health", "case": "PARTO_RS", "rep": 1, "sql_ok": true, "chart_ok": true, "latency_s": 12.571, "requests": [{"endpoint": "/responses", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "low"}, {"endpoint": "/responses", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "low"}, {"endpoint": "/responses", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "low"}, {"endpoint": "/responses", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": "low"}]}
{"status": "answered", "answer": "Os partos espontâneos cefálicos registrados em hospitais do Rio Grande do Sul atingiram o pico em 2018, com 30.639 internações, e depois caíram para 24.611 em 2025. O gráfico mostra uma tendência de alta até 2018, seguida de queda, mais acentuada entre 2022 e 2025.\n\nA contagem considera hospitais localizados no estado e o ano da data de entrada; 2025 pode representar um período ainda incompleto.", "sql": "SELECT\n  YEAR(i.DT_INTER) AS ano,\n  c.DESCRICAO AS diagnostico,\n  COUNT(*) AS internacoes\nFROM internacao AS i\nJOIN cid AS c\n  ON i.DIAG_PRINC = c.CID\nJOIN hospital AS h\n  ON i.CNES = h.CNES\nJOIN municipios AS m\n  ON h.MUNIC_MOV = m.CO_MUNICIPIO_6D\nWHERE i.DIAG_PRINC = 'O800'\n  AND m.SG_UF = 'RS'\nGROUP BY YEAR(i.DT_INTER), c.DESCRICAO\nORDER BY ano", "rows": [[2008, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 28359], [2009, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 28281], [2010, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 27995], [2011, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 28261], [2012, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 27083], [2013, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 26434], [2014, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 27208], [2015, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 29643], [2016, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 29231], [2017, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 30364], [2018, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 30639], [2019, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 30450], [2020, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 30446], [2021, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 29017], [2022, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 28228], [2023, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 26563], [2024, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 24794], [2025, "Parto espontaneo cefalico", 24611]], "columns": ["ano", "diagnostico", "internacoes"], "chart": {"type": "linha", "points": [[2008, 28359], [2009, 28281], [2010, 27995], [2011, 28261], [2012, 27083], [2013, 26434], [2014, 27208], [2015, 29643], [2016, 29231], [2017, 30364], [2018, 30639], [2019, 30450], [2020, 30446], [2021, 29017], [2022, 28228], [2023, 26563], [2024, 24794], [2025, 24611]]}, "truncated": false, "projec